  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Strengthening capacities for increasing energy efficiency in residential sector</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Build capacities of the Eco-Fund to become reliable institution skilled to design and manage implementation of programmes and projects improving energy efficiency, environment protection and other sustainability projects, in line with the determined national priorities, ensuring that investments yield maximum environmental and economic benefits. Reaching this goal will enable the country to reduce GHG emissions and to become more resilient to climate change through institutional capacity building and raising awareness of the public.</narrative>
  </description>
